{"version":1,"content":"<p>四仔界有唔少身經百戰嘅脱星，佢哋嘅床戰表現收放自如，令人讚嘆，足以揚威頒獎台或打入名人堂。</p><p>至於今日同大家見面嘅Alexa Payne，雖然出道只係兩年多，資歷尚淺，但床上演出冇得彈，甚至成為四仔迷眼中嘅教材級別呢！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&amp;l</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T15:23:57.715008+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T15:00:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T15:17:16.138283+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T15:17:16.138283+00:00","content_hash":"0cec3ae04ac7ecb7dc035d8ebddbf8754c991d2cd03b9232fd4603a63b66fad4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}